# Cloudflare Pages redirects (R2, refinement 20260910).
#
# `/institutional/tickers/{T}/` is not a page: the 13F view of a ticker lives
# on the unified ticker page's institutional section. ONE dynamic rule instead
# of ~3,850 stub pages — the built tree already exceeds the 15,000-file
# self-cap and Cloudflare Pages hard-fails a deploy over 20,000 files.
#
# `:t` matches exactly one path segment, so the rule never shadows the real
# holders pages at `/institutional/tickers/{T}/holders/` (two segments), and
# nothing on the site links to the bare route (the congress ticker page links
# the holders page only when it was built). Behaviour on Cloudflare — asset
# vs redirect precedence and fragment support — is an operator check on the
# deployed preview; `astro preview` does not evaluate this file.
/institutional/tickers/:t/ /tickers/:t/#institutional 301
